                    (@Field.toCommRing k inst))
                  (@NSP14.NumericalSemigroup.formalPieceGCommRing (S.intervalCompletion he) k
                    (@Field.toCommRing k inst)))))
            (@NSP14.NumericalSemigroup.fullPolynomialAlgebraFormalG (S.intervalCompletion he) k
